---
/**
 * AgentConversation — simulated AI-agent chat showing an agent searching live
 * supply and completing a booking + payment through Wink in one flow.
 * The messages animate in sequence (.wink-msg-* keyframes in styles/tweaks.css).
 * Used on: /agentic-ai/ (hero, right column).
 *
 * ── SWAPPABLE INFOGRAPHIC ─────────────────────────────────────────────
 * Drop-in slot. To improve or replace the visual, edit ONLY the body of this
 * file — swap in a redesigned mockup, an inline <svg>, or an <img>. Keep the
 * component name + outer wrapper so the hero layout stays untouched.
 * ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 */
---

<div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-6 -z-10 rounded-[3rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ff6b35]/20 to-[#a855f7]/20 blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-4 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur @lg:p-5">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
      <span class="size-2 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-white/50">AI agent · connected to Wink MCP</span>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3 pt-4">
      <div class="wink-msg wink-msg-1 ml-auto max-w-[88%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ff6b35] to-[#ec4899] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-white">Find an adults-only hotel in Chiang Mai next month with a spa — and book it.</div>
      <div class="wink-msg wink-msg-2 max-w-[88%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md bg-white/[0.07] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-white/85"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#ff8a5c]">api_search</span> → live rates across 11 channel managers…</div>
      <div class="wink-msg wink-msg-3 max-w-[92%] rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.05] p-3.5">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Aleenta Retreat · Chiang Mai</p>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-white/55">Adults-only · spa · free cancellation</p>
          </div>
          <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-bold text-emerald-300">Available</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 font-heading text-base font-bold text-white">USD 240 <span class="text-xs font-medium text-white/50">/ night</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="wink-msg wink-msg-4 inline-flex max-w-[88%] items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-300">✅ Booked · #WK-2X9F · paid via Wink</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
